<h2>Reset Authentication Details</h2>
<h3>Reset Password</h3>
<form id="resetpass" action="/request_password_reset" method="POST">
: if ($user) {
    <label for="password">Password:</label>
    <input type="password" class="cooltext" name="password" placeholder="password123" />
    <input type="hidden" name="username" value="<: $user :>" />
: } else {
    <label for="username">Username:</label>
    <input type="text" class="cooltext" name="username" placeholder="DrBoomer" />
: }
    <input type="submit" value="Reset Password">
</form>

<br /><br />
<h3>Lost your authenticator?</h3>
<p>
    TOTP cannot be turned off &mdash; losing a phone is not a reason to stop
    having a second factor.  Your enrolment is still on the server, so ask
    whoever runs this site to read it back to you with <code>bin/totp</code>,
    and scan it into a new authenticator.
</p>
